			#<s_cl> = 0
			o<s_clamp> if [ABS[#<s_zc> - #<z_end>] GT #<s_reach>]
				#<s_cl> = 1
				(no crossing within reach, so the level has nothing to end ON)
				(ahead of it. It runs to the end of the feature - where the)
				(contour flattens - and not to an arbitrary length: clamping)
				(to the reach itself gave 1.9714 mm where the chamfer is 1 mm,)
				(and the surplus ran beside the pre-finish contour.)
