	o<ld_gate> if [[#<_pl_sect_count> GT 0] AND [#<_pl_wdeep_ok> GT 0]]
		(the entry END, and the direction the lead comes in FROM. A forward)
		(pass enters at z_start and is led into from before it; a reversed)
		(pass enters at z_end_cut, at the far end, and is led into from)
		(beyond that. Getting this backwards would test the window the pass)
		(is cutting away from.)
