					#<ld_hi> = #<ld_wf>
				o<ld_wo> endif
				(overlap, in two short tests. One combined condition is how)
				(the retract walk earned a "Command too long" - the)
				(interpreter refuses the whole file at the line-length)
				(limit, so these stay small on purpose.)
				#<ld_ov> = 1
